{"created": "2026-09-13T04:56:57.751799+00:00", "modified": "2026-09-30T03:40:12.222498+00:00", "id": 22732327, "conceptrecid": "21330094", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22732327", "conceptdoi": "10.5281/zenodo.21330094", "doi_url": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22732327", "metadata": {"title": "TQH-C2: An Encrypted Command-and-Control Traffic Dataset Across Protocols and Encryption Layers", "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.22732327", "publication_date": "2026-09-13", "description": "<p><strong>Version 1.2.2</strong>: Added the feature-table builder <code>build_features_v3.py</code> to <code>TQH-C2_scripts.zip</code>, so the released Parquet feature tables (including JA4/JA4S/JA4H columns) are fully reproducible from the conn.log/labeled.jsonl records. Data records are unchanged from v1.2.0/v1.2.1.</p>\n<p><strong>Version 1.2.1</strong>: Added the Testbed D (Merlin / HTTP-2-over-TLS) collection drivers <code>run_cell_h2.sh</code> and <code>run_D_all.sh</code> to <code>TQH-C2_scripts.zip</code>, completing the released collection code for all four testbeds. Dataset records (pcap, labels, features) are unchanged from v1.2.0.</p>\n<p>TQH-C2 (TLS + QUIC + HTTP Command-and-Control) is a labeled network-traffic dataset for research on decryption-free detection of encrypted C2 channels. Its defining property is a controlled comparison across encryption profiles: the same MITRE ATT&amp;CK kill-chain is executed identically over four encryption profiles &mdash; Sliver over TLS (Testbed A), Merlin over HTTP/3/QUIC (Testbed B), Mythic over HTTP with AES-encrypted body (Testbed C), and Merlin over HTTP/2-over-TLS (Testbed D) &mdash; so that the only systematically varied factor is the encryption/transport profile. Testbeds B and D share the same Merlin framework and differ only in transport, forming a controlled pair for isolating the transport.</p>\n<p>The dataset is organized as a 48-cell grid: 4 encryption profiles &times; 4 beacon intervals (30/300/1800/3600 s) &times; 3 jitter levels (0/30/70%), with concurrent benign background traffic in every cell. The release includes raw PCAPs per cell, Zeek logs, per-flow ATT&amp;CK labels (labeled.jsonl), extracted feature tables (Parquet) with JA4/JA4S/JA4H fingerprint columns, sanitized collection/labeling/feature-extraction code for reproducibility, and SHA-256 checksums. See README.md for full documentation.</p>", "access_right": "open", "creators": [{"name": "Jeon, Deokjo", "affiliation": "Seoul School of Integrated Sciences & Technologies (aSSIST)", "orcid": "0000-0002-0343-3384"}, {"name": "Park, DongGue", "affiliation": "Soonchunhyang University", "orcid": "0000-0002-5864-8825"}], "keywords": ["encrypted traffic", "command and control", "C2 detection", "TLS", "QUIC", "HTTP", "JA4 fingerprint", "Zeek", "network security dataset", "MITRE ATT&CK"], "version": "1.2.2", "resource_type": {"title": "Dataset", "type": "dataset"}, "license": {"id": "cc-by-4.0"}, "relations": {"version": [{"index": 6, "is_last": false, "parent": {"pid_type": "recid", "pid_value": "21330094"}}]}}, "title": "TQH-C2: An Encrypted Command-and-Control Traffic Dataset Across Protocols and Encryption Layers", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327", "self_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22732327", "preview_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22732327?preview=1", "doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22732327", "self_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.22732327", "self_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.22732327", "reserve_doi": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/draft/pids/doi", "parent": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/21330094", "parent_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/21330094", "parent_doi": "https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21330094", "parent_doi_html": "https://zenodo.org/doi/10.5281/zenodo.21330094", "self_iiif_manifest": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22732327/manifest", "self_iiif_sequence": "https://zenodo.org/api/iiif/record:22732327/sequence/default", "files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/files", "media_files": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/media-files", "latest": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/versions/latest", "latest_html": "https://zenodo.org/records/22732327/latest", "versions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/versions", "draft": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/draft", "access_links": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/access/links", "access_grants": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/access/grants", "access_users": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/access/users", "access_request": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/access/request", "access": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/access", "communities": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/communities", "communities-suggestions": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/communities-suggestions", "request_deletion": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/request-deletion", "file_modification": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/file-modification", "quota_increase": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/quota-increase", "requests": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/requests"}, "updated": "2026-09-30T03:40:12.222498+00:00", "recid": "22732327", "revision": 14, "files": [{"id": "fa0113ff-905c-423a-badb-4b3fa7c8c8f9", "key": "TQH-C2_features_D.zip", "size": 1222048, "checksum": "md5:f1f9c3c3cc150570c26cfb6c5ca5d492", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/files/TQH-C2_features_D.zip/content"}}, {"id": "a6d8a404-48f6-4d6c-a46e-5b797fce5d03", "key": "TQH-C2_pcap_B_merlin_quic_v110.zip", "size": 4261997455, "checksum": "md5:0a5aae88f288f20358d94f70b9ba1f5f", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/records/22732327/files/TQH-C2_pcap_B_merlin_quic_v110.zip/content"}}, {"id": "30762cbe-c7ad-4119-afc0-24545ce6c924", "key": "TQH-C2_pcap_A_sliver_tls.zip", "size": 33399375434, "checksum": "md5:a48cd911df671193c207f2d0589be259", "links": {"self": "https://zenodo.org/api/r